  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>&#952;</mi></math> denotes the acute angle between the curves, <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> at a point of their intersection, then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to:"
  },
