  "solution": {
    "text": "Intersection points of given curves are  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>  for  <math><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></math>  curve  <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> <br/><br/>         <math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>  or  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/>        For  <math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></math>  curve,  <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math> <br/><br/>         <math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>  or  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/>         <math><mo>∴</mo></math>   <math><mo>|</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>θ</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>  or  <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/>         <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  (In both cases)"
